              "hideComponent": "false",
              "jcr:created": "Mon Sep 26 2022 19:08:34 GMT+0000",
              "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
              "text": "<h1><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">πdrive 2 is part of Signature 2 Portfolio, the comprehensive and customizable neurosurgical high speed drill platform.</span></span></h1>\n",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Feb 13 2023 15:15:00 GMT+0000",
              "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
              "textIsRich": "true"
            },
            "text_983377512": {
              "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
              "bottomPadding": "8",
              "jcr:createdBy": "cathy.lapico@stryker.com",
              "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "cathy.lapico@stryker.com",
              "hideComponent": "false",
              "jcr:created": "Mon Sep 26 2022 19:09:29 GMT+0000",
              "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
              "text": "<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1em\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><b>½” shorter</b> motor length than πdrive 2+</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1em\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><b>21% lighter</b> than πdrive+</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1em\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><b>6.5% better motor balance</b> vs πdrive</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1em\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><b>16% better motor balance</b> vs S2 drill</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><b>50% reduction</b> in sound energy vs πdrive</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">Works with <b>I.D. Touch software</b> for custom drill response</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">New, exclusive <b>KnurLock grip technology</b></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">Matte anodizing and drill coating reduce light reflection/glare off drill surface, reduce corrosion and preserve exterior marking 4+ years (minimum 400 cycles)</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><b>Drill tracker adapter</b> provides future-ready design</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><b>75K RPM </b>electric motor</span></span><br>\n</p>\n",
              "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Oct 19 2022 15:41:01 GMT+0000",
              "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
              "textIsRich": "true"
            }
          },
