          "jcr:created": "Mon Aug 19 2019 17:51:57 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><b data-rte-class=\"rte-temp\" style=\"color: inherit; font-family: &quot;Futura LT W01&quot;, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 17.5px;\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><b data-rte-class=\"rte-temp\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">CORE 2 Console with</span></b></span></b><br>\n</p>\n<h4><b data-rte-class=\"rte-temp\"><b data-rte-class=\"rte-temp\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><b data-rte-class=\"rte-temp\"><b data-rte-class=\"rte-temp\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">I.D. Touch software</span></b></b></span></b></b></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Universal control center across Signature components</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Capable of running two drills simultaneously and irrigation</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Industry-exclusive I.D. Touch software adjusts torque 0-100% for tailored drill response and tactile feel</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Custom settings can be saved in user preferences<br>\n</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n",
